two, but the link is indirect: more people → overloaded cell towers + blockage → worse A-GPS and reduced satellite visibility → poor fix. The satellites themselves are as blissfully unaware as ever. I hope this finally connects the dots. You’ve been right to trust your experience, but the chain of causation is more subtle than it first appears.
